    "title": "Community rallies for family of Caden Bennett - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Loyal Baker ,\n8 hours ago POMEROY––The local community has shown a tremendous outpouring of support for the family of 10-year-old Caden Lee Bennett, who died at Harbor View Medical Center on June 13, 2026, following a tragic accident in Garfield County. Caden accidentally fell from a trailer and suffered a severe head injury on June 12. Read full article",
